    "animation": "Static locked camera. A short 2–3 second comedic beat. Maia Melodies remains hidden inside the huge cardboard compost crate with only her head and upper shoulders visible above the open flaps. She slowly rises just a few centimetres, cautiously glances to one side and then the other with her eyes and a very small head movement, then gently presses one earcup of her black headphones as if checking whether it is time to begin. Her expression is focused, mischievous and controlled; she does not speak or lip-sync. The cardboard flaps react only with tiny natural flexing from her movement. Preserve Maia's exact face, lavender-platinum bob, headphones, white shirt, body proportions and identity. Preserve the exact camera, crate size and position, green leaf symbol, storage room, doorway, lamp, walls, floor and warm lighting. The concealed DJ equipment must remain completely invisible. No full reveal, no climbing out, no dancing, no waving, no confetti, no explosion, no camera movement, no zoom, no cuts, no new people, no extra limbs, no face morphing, no text changes and no watermark."
